{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d3527ac83386f643d6e2c1774a18a354abea5da343e3b888c5674e26959bff3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6112a73e9dee3bcb607667b581d20cd032d8f99f11e66ff8378c75d7c522c226",
      "text": "老妈亲传的力量",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc4a64348116ac4deb81ef47c27699e3cc39695aa7ec10d90c290eef49151afa",
      "text": "赶往工作现场的路上，制作人突然被陌生外国人搭话。\n看到慌慌张张的制作人，春名跑了过来，\n没想到对方居然是熟人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6112a73e9dee3bcb607667b581d20cd032d8f99f11e66ff8378c75d7c522c226",
      "text": "老妈亲传的力量",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6249deb3034a4b8606b9bd71b177e16a9a15bee09bae81802b69852398d43fb1",
      "text": "……然后啊，那家店的新品甜甜圈超好吃的！\n要是今天也卖就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d63ece1c0a6156ac4eb3a0dda0a224c4f03b8616d24125472759c44e72cdde9e",
      "text": "我在官网上看过照片了，\n每一种看起来都很美味呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a1cecae26592f208a06ce8e6000ee9cb77ffefa5ef6db2312498b75bcfd19b",
      "text": "是吧！然后……咦？好像掉了什么东西。\n我过去看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff96e21376883c9d62945af21f3cea2f338a7f9f6d857a8b92147f519d8a49a0",
      "text": "好的，我在这里等您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a89fbc4ae233973177c83e1421d3dfb07431fe76a0d72139bd21d6e253bf9bf",
      "text": "Hey！　Did you see my cellphone anywhere？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e1c68ea5885d5b8fe7822ee67aa623dc195b39256cba1c7538c7ec37cc04df",
      "text": "I lost it somewhere.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45af071828dacd950ac6ccebcee9f95444c230a1c7f2012d9de53e05331110cd",
      "text": "哎！？那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e84820a85745c9f2de54ab0fe97900e484c00bdf0b371f2e98fad90f4e5b162",
      "text": "久等了，●●●●プロデューサー！\n……话说，怎么了？认识的人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:654e21224d4d14ce93f5c9b4c817f366831dbf3ce5f777d9947c53a4a102ca13",
      "text": "要是有什么事，我来听听看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b799aae68022c5cebf26b604ce53404f8f5bab6f92cc3c5258b5cf2860a9f8",
      "text": "……！\nHaruna！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16be4ef0bfdc92d35c0cb1c35ffcbc286baa4f86c502c7836126b8342a2bc04d",
      "text": "哎呀，这不是比尔嘛！\nIt's been yonks！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc55d9ff66046c985683a30d2de1e07b452db5aeca589a910558f6d2f63af1a",
      "text": "Peace out！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7783b884043bdb51990b4c7dac3e0753aa5b5df9cb30a5ac6fb150fbd4d23ae3",
      "text": "……久等了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那家伙把手机弄丢了正发愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d4a9035b3304d6c490bbc14faa04eed5b962c8eab42dfdb0aa56ae64bdeb82",
      "text": "我捡到的手机好像正好就是他的！\n还给他之后他可高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aab15c62ff7da0c5aebca3fd48596225825b761a0277c2d4b8303539a9319e51",
      "text": "没想到会在这里遇见他。\n真是吓了一跳啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bef90af0a91b31db47e7ee3757da54eed3e837f6dccdab92e6fb6f838450684",
      "text": "我刚才没太听懂，多亏您帮了大忙。\n非常感谢，春名先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2e95dee857ec7613d722b8951014d6a7c0974a7ab62c025094bb8d3b1946f5b",
      "text": "这点小事不算什么啦。\n之前我和比尔在同一个工地打过工。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80cdf70ded6df277a475bdf775a7e00706fbb9e8634c47021f48926600efae26",
      "text": "那里只有我一个人会说英语，\n给他做着做着翻译就成了朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eae1b8016823d2afe3792cc7ac76b1e24d4aa833de524ac0d875b3c760b0aaf7",
      "text": "不过，搭话的人是比尔真是太好了。\n一开始我还以为你是被不良少年纠缠上了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b947d8b31616008d1469728d7563e4e1c27722bf948618fdd12681f6943afff0",
      "text": "我本以为自己对不良少年和大块头已经挺习惯了，\n但事发突然还是慌了手脚呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a89c95aff7c786569d1bb290c9772d39ecd218dd6c7494fb95e9fb5c59ced9",
      "text": "哈哈哈。没事，要是出什么事我会保护你的。\n制作人不用担心啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329b45cb19cd7f6739deff00854fb54bd88a0e9d3535b36296a3b735f599097a",
      "text": "十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7d2c456472f5c1507b0508d45a162f37183bee4273984a9467eea832dd921e",
      "text": "太好了呢，春名先生。\n买到了慰劳品甜甜圈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7beab32821ec8d90021abd8ee32231267a095961e4b4bf6998ca40f3529db89f",
      "text": "是啊！连新品甜甜圈也买到了，\n我也想早点吃到啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e2eefea4f3409f0c2a6fc6bb917a29467cc05a231f5029ca7d438d3233f18c",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那边的两位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b936c17716900ca05e9fff1010b13ce365dc3dc0a9b8bc25e71adf0d6d38d009",
      "text": "手里拿着看起来挺好吃的玩意儿嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c89097f2d1760807ce8174345f87986c09535346825e5e1ac0c23765829ff9",
      "text": "那个……请问你们是哪位？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47343b7007ce6f5fe41d27f4e7892276ec06d07946ef8f0a58102c8cbe065ef",
      "text": "管他是谁呢！比起这个，那盒子里装的东西，\n让给我们怎么样啊？可以吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9546c308b958fea8dcc9af9e29cb0d1ff6090a5cded98ed3cf01aefe734d6fbc",
      "text": "（这种时候……作为制作人\n我必须保护好春名先生！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95a45f0c80ef6cd6fc159bb6cdea3c1cfc6d613e754e2fa98dfe02720af81063",
      "text": "不好意思。\n我们有点赶时间……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c506ba784b8383e4a1c4e9fa0f038a4a0aa246556bec66f43de5e0e74fa5a7",
      "text": "……退后，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我来当他们的对手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9ab45ff58aee40308112c57b7ec0f6b9fe427cd2c5d0b500b2cd183de8c002",
      "text": "不行的！\n春名先生要是受伤了就糟了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c6970f80da982c8a0da266615002cda23191929df01cc7ef9a16a7f58452fc",
      "text": "谢谢你担心我。\n不过，我没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba1bc766ff178da5b1431c1391769457237c1b41de37b77915448b5bf0fdc5a9",
      "text": "切，还在那逞强。\n说大话可是会让你后悔的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a2e2485521df05b4b114e7346037e6831deb2ce66bc6299da8d5c08bdbb55f5",
      "text": "这句话，原封不动奉还给你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:723dd52c9bcb6206e1c5e366e77dd2d087c6c34856831fe3ed526dac499be4d5",
      "text": "吃我一拳……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6393328656690e2c400d1d32f8a21773fadb5947654035d1f35c51280fd101",
      "text": "嘿哟……\n不管打多少次，那种拳头都是打不中我的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2938f61168349546127e7b6a9e7e3b3ce6e881010fb409455be7532ac2ae19f6",
      "text": "哈啊……哈啊……\n少在那闪来闪去的。这次看招……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61421c11b9ca44a8753ede88e009d5b47758835896a546bf98c5029aa10f1300",
      "text": "你们几个，还没看清实力差距吗？\n……看看这盒子里面的甜甜圈吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a81eb1ca15a9d80dadbb423ea7f6c38411403ef676a6687844b1b3a96d4961c",
      "text": "瞧啊……就像什么事都没发生一样安安稳稳地躺着呢。\n这代表着什么，你们明白吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f881142f526180a2066e4792b96fa987291a8ded1ab1b82d9324b53af9079ae",
      "text": "（好、好厉害！明明有那么大动作，\n甜甜圈居然还排得整整齐齐……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5226dff5eadc1982bc465d9483072e7a1f99c68af3ea23baf7e02516348fb838",
      "text": "可恶！\n下次再碰到给我记住了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a57235561e9c8c8fd512f9f63f684e57a9259f16472c64a8e491f708a3e17f7e",
      "text": "唉，被奇怪的家伙纠缠上了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b25b51c484dcd4bb764cd37fe7682327c83970384caa5e5c0efc01eda21e32",
      "text": "春名先生才没事吧？\n我没能帮上忙，真对不起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a77e34188801e56536c3236554b4843f852f8636fffd10687729faa9cbdc7b1",
      "text": "没有啦，我这边才不好意思呢。我好像\n挺扎眼的，偶尔就会被人找碴打架。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a0d8aa05fc91907acee5b232fd54d3bdf77df77ea5c3dfa43c47b3b92b8fbe",
      "text": "虽说像刚才那样随便应付应付就行了，\n但今天把你给卷进来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc4adaa2875a5a337e9e0226500ebac9ed1aba9e33ca515af04a9f9c72b43e2",
      "text": "我也必须像春名先生那样，\n变得能轻松应付他们才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659cef7a529d43c2d116c38ce36de69f89ffb9b42460b3cf36a2df906e550c47",
      "text": "哎呀～，咱们这里打架厉害的家伙多的是，\n制作人不用连这个都变强啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb70553358c55c41b7cc7fa1b581e1547607972c5d5a30c76f5c63d8d831fca",
      "text": "像是神速一魂，还有THE 虎牙道的那两个人。\n虽然年龄和我差不多，但绝对超级强啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee082350a3cf93c3fa5bdfd566c71e6a6e6e1ec5977af3de77704d5f121347b",
      "text": "……那个，\n春名先生为什么会这么能打呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:633c80f8d78f66ae68b077081e26ad0b33fdb38a9829dcfff988710e6d1326d8",
      "text": "多亏了我老妈。从小时候起，\n她就教了我打架的精髓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:483d8cfd65fc050baa647e50bb014fb7a51ea8249911f8d4329763c59ccfb5f9",
      "text": "啊，我可从来没主动挑衅过别人哦！\n不过啊，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f3d6c13331d8316a03e309f93a6b8b05655c6f93d85d55ec6818df55886088",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー遇到困难的时候，\n我会去救你的！交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b3fe480def2da31f6dbf21ae7c9fd421054bbf8cc495c7236c5ce7e7079d0fb",
      "text": "好的！我也为了能在春名先生遇到困难时\n派上用场而努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd77888c847548f72ca9eea3c4f5be2749dfa49319308026afc24a30e3db3acf",
      "text": "出拳的时候，\n要有稍微扭转的意识……像这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a62b7d350376465a6fe656efd9a44127275be7c779e7fea78b7bb767d322def",
      "text": "这样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88b3bb31e5aff465ac25da98cf02dfc3ca03d0089b4a4fd31de7897eb97f67d5",
      "text": "不对，不能只用手臂，要从这里拧转。还有，双脚要站稳……对，就是那种感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa7b06ccdea265817445e981abf5011f7211bc2cf1e89f3aead50484967b1454",
      "text": "这份力量，在想保护自己或者谁的时候派得上用场。\n到了那个时候，一定要保护好你重要的人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340b6787c19258db027b2d5048ccf7e3c8f728077ce0c39adf35294c53fa02e9",
      "text": "重要的……人……\n……嗯，我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
